    "# 🧬 EGFR Conditional Binder — ColabFold Multimer Validation\n",
    "## Anthropic × Adaptyv Protein Design Competition 2026 — Challenge 1\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Predict binder-EGFR complex structures using AlphaFold2 Multimer via ColabFold.  \n",
    "**Input:** Passing designs from ESMFold step  \n",
    "**Filter criteria:** ipTM > 0.55, pTM > 0.65, interface pLDDT > 70\n",
    "\n",
    "### What this validates:\n",
    "1. **Binding confidence** — Does the binder dock to EGFR Domain III?\n",
    "2. **Interface quality** — Are His residues positioned to contact D355/E352?\n",
    "3. **Cross-species score** — Do contacts fall on conserved residues?\n",
    "\n",
    "### EGFR Domain III sequence (human, 175 aa, residues 310-481):\n",
    "Used as the \"target\" in multimer prediction.\n"
   ]
